-<!-- STUDIO NAV END --><main class="studio-wrap" id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><p class="eyebrow">FOR WRITERS, STREAMERS & CURIOUS PEOPLE</p><h1>Press kit</h1><p class="studio-lead">The studio, in its own words. Project artwork, useful links, and a direct line for questions.</p><section class="studio-card"><h2>About the studio</h2><p id="studio-description">Brok3n by Design is an independent game studio where each project is designed, directed, and built by a single creator using modern creative tools.</p><p>Independently created by Brok3n by Design.</p><div class="studio-actions"><button type="button" class="studio-button" data-copy-studio hidden>Copy studio description</button><a class="studio-button" href="press/studio-facts.txt" download>Download factsheet</a><a class="studio-button" href="mailto:brok3nbydesign@pm.me">Contact the studio</a></div><p id="copy-message" role="status"></p></section><section id="brand-film"><h2>Brand film &amp; trailers</h2><p>Watch the released Brok3n by Design brand film, or visit the YouTube channel for more studio trailers.</p><div class="studio-actions"><a class="studio-button primary" href="https://youtu.be/zhIMgJ5sl7Q" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch the brand film ↗</a><a class="studio-button" href="https://x.com/brok3nbydesign/status/2108530273004421284?s=20" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on X ↗</a><a class="studio-button" href="https://www.youtube.com/@Brok3n-j8j" target="_blank" rel="noopener">YouTube trailers ↗</a></div></section><section><h2>Studio marks</h2><p class="studio-small">Official studio logo and compact B3 mark for press and editorial use.</p><div class="studio-grid"><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/x-logo2.png" alt="Brok3n by Design B3 thumbnail" width="220" height="203" class="press-brand-thumbnail"><h3>B3 thumbnail</h3><p class="studio-small">Current studio thumbnail and social artwork.</p><a href="images/studio/x-logo2.png" download>Download B3 thumbnail (PNG)</a></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/b3d-web.webp" alt="Brok3n by Design wordmark"><a href="images/studio/b3d.png" download>Download studio logo (PNG)</a></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/studio-mark.svg" alt="B3 studio mark" style="max-height:160px;object-fit:contain"><a href="images/studio/studio-mark.svg" download>Download B3 mark (SVG)</a></article></div></section><section><h2>Projects & selected artwork</h2><p>Check each project page for its latest status before publishing. Concept artwork is identified separately from playable games.</p><div class="studio-grid"><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/cover/glass-and-fortune.webp" alt="Glass &amp; Fortune artwork" loading="lazy" width="720" height="450"><p class="eyebrow">Private alpha</p><h3>Glass &amp; Fortune</h3><p>A tactile roguelike built around five glass dice, risky combinations, and a masked fortune-teller who never gives you the whole truth.</p><p><a href="glass-and-fortune.html">Project details</a> · <a href="images/dice/glass-01.png" download>Download artwork</a></p></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/cover/bid-and-buried.webp" alt="Bid &amp; Buried artwork" loading="lazy" width="720" height="450"><p class="eyebrow">In development</p><h3>Bid &amp; Buried</h3><p>Peek inside a locker, buy it, dig front to back, and choose what earns space in your van.</p><p><a href="bid-and-buried.html">Project details</a> · <a href="images/locker/buried-05.png" download>Download artwork</a></p></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/cover/speck.webp" alt="Speck artwork" loading="lazy" width="720" height="450"><p class="eyebrow">Private development</p><h3>Speck</h3><p>A shared survival sandbox about beginning as almost nothing, shaping the objects around you, and turning an empty patch of world into home.</p><p><a href="speck.html">Project details</a> · <a href="images/speck/speck_01.png" download>Download artwork</a></p></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/cover/wrfm.webp" alt="WRFM Radio artwork" loading="lazy" width="720" height="450"><p class="eyebrow">Completed · Live now</p><h3>WRFM Radio</h3><p>Genuinely good, vocal-free smooth jazz you can leave on all day, hosted by Vera Lang with strange callers and developer-minded commercials.</p><p><a href="wrfm.html">Project details</a> · <a href="images/wrfm/wrfm_03.png" download>Download artwork</a></p></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/cover/pocket-wilds.webp" alt="Pocket Wilds artwork" loading="lazy" width="720" height="450"><p class="eyebrow">Private development</p><h3>Pocket Wilds</h3><p>A retro fantasy adventure where free-roaming exploration gives way to tactical dice battles when a boss seals the door.</p><p><a href="pocket-wilds.html">Project details</a> · <a href="images/pocket-wilds-1.png" download>Download artwork</a></p></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/cover/doqi.webp" alt="DOQI artwork" loading="lazy" width="720" height="450"><p class="eyebrow">Prototype · on hold</p><h3>DOQI</h3><p>The Department of Questionable Inventions: a satirical personality game about ridiculous decisions and their consequences.</p><p><a href="doqi.html">Project details</a> · <a href="images/doqi/doqi_01.jpg" download>Download artwork</a></p></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/cover/macabre-dolls.webp" alt="Macabre Dolls artwork" loading="lazy" width="720" height="450"><p class="eyebrow">Concept · not developed</p><h3>Macabre Dolls</h3><p>A collection of haunting artwork and card-game ideas. A concept archive, with no playable game or teaser.</p><p><a href="macabre-dolls.html">Project details</a> · <a href="images/dolls/creepy-dolls_1.jpg" download>Download artwork</a></p></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/cover/labyrinth-fate.webp" alt="The Maze artwork" loading="lazy" width="720" height="450"><p class="eyebrow">In development</p><h3>The Maze</h3><p>A narrative dice game about choices, chance, and the consequences you carry through a hostile maze.</p><p><a href="labyrinth-fate.html">Project details</a> · <a href="images/studio/labyrinth-fate.svg" download>Download artwork</a></p></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/cover/juicebox.webp" alt="Juicebox artwork" loading="lazy" width="720" height="450"><p class="eyebrow">Film experiment</p><h3>Juicebox</h3><p>An experimental short film in early development, exploring character, voice, and self-contained stories.</p><p><a href="juicebox.html">Project details</a> · <a href="images/studio/juicebox.svg" download>Download artwork</a></p></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/cover/graffiti.webp" alt="Graffiti artwork" loading="lazy" width="720" height="450"><p class="eyebrow">Live guestbook</p><h3>Graffiti</h3><p>A shared pixel-art guestbook where every visitor can draw, sign, and leave a permanent mark on the wall.</p><p><a href="graffiti.html">Project details</a> · <a href="images/graffiti/graffiti_logo.png" download>Download artwork</a></p></article></div></section></main><footer class="studio-footer"><p>Independently created by Brok3n by Design.</p><!-- STUDIO LINKS START -->
+<!-- STUDIO NAV END --><main class="studio-wrap" id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><p class="eyebrow">FOR WRITERS, STREAMERS & CURIOUS PEOPLE</p><h1>Press kit</h1><p class="studio-lead">The studio, in its own words. Project artwork, useful links, and a direct line for questions.</p><section class="studio-card"><h2>About the studio</h2><p id="studio-description">Brok3n by Design is an independent game studio where each project is designed, directed, and built by a single creator using modern creative tools.</p><p>Independently created by Brok3n by Design.</p><div class="studio-actions"><button type="button" class="studio-button" data-copy-studio hidden>Copy studio description</button><a class="studio-button" href="press/studio-facts.txt" download>Download factsheet</a><a class="studio-button" href="mailto:brok3nbydesign@pm.me">Contact the studio</a></div><p id="copy-message" role="status"></p></section><section id="brand-film"><h2>Brand film &amp; trailers</h2><p>Watch the released Brok3n by Design brand film, or visit the YouTube channel for more studio trailers.</p><div class="studio-actions"><a class="studio-button primary" href="https://youtu.be/zhIMgJ5sl7Q" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch the brand film ↗</a><a class="studio-button" href="https://x.com/brok3nbydesign/status/2108530273004421284?s=20" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on X ↗</a><a class="studio-button" href="https://www.youtube.com/@Brok3n-j8j" target="_blank" rel="noopener">YouTube trailers ↗</a></div></section><section><h2>Studio marks</h2><p class="studio-small">Official studio logo and compact B3 mark for press and editorial use.</p><div class="studio-grid"><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/x-logo2.png" alt="Brok3n by Design B3 thumbnail" width="220" height="203" class="press-brand-thumbnail"><h3>B3 thumbnail</h3><p class="studio-small">Current studio thumbnail and social artwork.</p><a href="images/studio/x-logo2.png" download>Download B3 thumbnail (PNG)</a></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/b3d-web.webp" alt="Brok3n by Design wordmark"><a href="images/studio/b3d.png" download>Download studio logo (PNG)</a></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/studio-mark.svg" alt="B3 studio mark" style="max-height:160px;object-fit:contain"><a href="images/studio/studio-mark.svg" download>Download B3 mark (SVG)</a></article></div></section><section><h2>Projects & selected artwork</h2><p>Check each project page for its latest status before publishing. Concept artwork is identified separately from playable games.</p><div class="studio-grid"><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/cover/glass-and-fortune.webp" alt="Glass &amp; Fortune artwork" loading="lazy" width="720" height="450"><p class="eyebrow">Private alpha</p><h3>Glass &amp; Fortune</h3><p>A tactile roguelike built around five glass dice, risky combinations, and a masked fortune-teller who never gives you the whole truth.</p><p><a href="glass-and-fortune.html">Project details</a> · <a href="images/dice/glass-01.png" download>Download artwork</a></p></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/cover/bid-and-buried.webp" alt="Bid &amp; Buried artwork" loading="lazy" width="720" height="450"><p class="eyebrow">In development</p><h3>Bid &amp; Buried</h3><p>Peek inside a locker, buy it, dig front to back, and choose what earns space in your van.</p><p><a href="bid-and-buried.html">Project details</a> · <a href="images/locker/buried-05.png" download>Download artwork</a></p></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/cover/speck.webp" alt="Speck artwork" loading="lazy" width="720" height="450"><p class="eyebrow">Private development</p><h3>Speck</h3><p>A shared survival sandbox about beginning as almost nothing, shaping the objects around you, and turning an empty patch of world into home.</p><p><a href="speck.html">Project details</a> · <a href="images/speck/speck_01.png" download>Download artwork</a></p></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/cover/wrfm.webp" alt="WRFM Radio artwork" loading="lazy" width="720" height="450"><p class="eyebrow">Completed · Live now</p><h3>WRFM Radio</h3><p>Genuinely good, vocal-free smooth jazz you can leave on all day, hosted by Vera Lang with strange callers and developer-minded commercials.</p><p><a href="wrfm.html">Project details</a> · <a href="images/wrfm/wrfm_03.png" download>Download artwork</a></p></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/cover/pocket-wilds.webp" alt="Pocket Wilds artwork" loading="lazy" width="720" height="450"><p class="eyebrow">Private development</p><h3>Pocket Wilds</h3><p>A retro fantasy adventure where free-roaming exploration gives way to tactical dice battles when a boss seals the door.</p><p><a href="pocket-wilds.html">Project details</a> · <a href="images/pocket-wilds-1.png" download>Download artwork</a></p></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/cover/doqi.webp" alt="DOQI artwork" loading="lazy" width="720" height="450"><p class="eyebrow">Prototype · on hold</p><h3>DOQI</h3><p>The Department of Questionable Inventions: a satirical personality game about ridiculous decisions and their consequences.</p><p><a href="doqi.html">Project details</a> · <a href="images/doqi/doqi_01.jpg" download>Download artwork</a></p></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/cover/macabre-dolls.webp" alt="Macabre Dolls artwork" loading="lazy" width="720" height="450"><p class="eyebrow">Concept · not developed</p><h3>Macabre Dolls</h3><p>A collection of haunting artwork and card-game ideas. A concept archive, with no playable game or teaser.</p><p><a href="macabre-dolls.html">Project details</a> · <a href="images/dolls/creepy-dolls_1.jpg" download>Download artwork</a></p></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/cover/labyrinth-fate.webp" alt="The Maze artwork" loading="lazy" width="720" height="450"><p class="eyebrow">In development</p><h3>The Maze</h3><p>A narrative dice game about choices, chance, and the consequences you carry through a hostile maze.</p><p><a href="labyrinth-fate.html">Project details</a> · <a href="images/studio/labyrinth-fate.svg" download>Download artwork</a></p></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/cover/juicebox.webp" alt="Juicebox artwork" loading="lazy" width="720" height="450"><p class="eyebrow">Film experiment</p><h3>Juicebox</h3><p>An experimental short film in early development, exploring character, voice, and self-contained stories.</p><p><a href="juicebox.html">Project details</a> · <a href="images/studio/juicebox.svg" download>Download artwork</a></p></article><article class="studio-card"><img src="images/studio/cover/graffiti.webp" alt="Graffiti artwork" loading="lazy" width="720" height="450"><p class="eyebrow">Live guestbook</p><h3>Graffiti</h3><p>A shared pixel-art guestbook where every visitor can draw, sign, and leave a permanent mark on the wall.</p><p><a href="graffiti.html">Project details</a> · <a href="images/studio/cover/graffiti.webp" download>Download artwork</a></p></article></div></section></main><footer class="studio-footer"><p>Independently created by Brok3n by Design.</p><!-- STUDIO LINKS START -->
